{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3652690/extras/045245fceb0ad048f361d90f5118c539.poster.avif?t=1769382556\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3652690/extras/045245fceb0ad048f361d90f5118c539.webm?t=1769382556\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3652690/extras/045245fceb0ad048f361d90f5118c539.mp4?t=1769382556\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No One Leaves the Field</strong> is a first-person folk horror game set in a cursed wheat field that changes every time you enter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After swerving to avoid a dog on a lonely back road, you wake beside your wrecked car\u2014keys missing, phone dead, and wheat stretching endlessly in every direction. The wind whispers your name. Shadows move just beyond the edge of your flashlight. You are not alone here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the field and uncover the story of the family who once called this farm home. Notes, objects, and strange rituals reveal how desperation turned to witchcraft, and how a plea for salvation birthed the curse that traps you now. But the wheat is alive, and something old watches from within.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3652690/extras/2e9469851204da2d1741a89bd3df5794.poster.avif?t=1769382556\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3652690/extras/2e9469851204da2d1741a89bd3df5794.webm?t=1769382556\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3652690/extras/2e9469851204da2d1741a89bd3df5794.mp4?t=1769382556\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What Awaits in the Field</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf3e <strong>A Maze That Shifts Each Run</strong><br>Paths, landmarks, and secrets rearrange with every attempt to escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd6f\ufe0f <strong>A Silent Scarecrow That Hunts</strong><br>It doesn\u2019t run. It doesn\u2019t speak. It waits\u2014for you to make a sound.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3652690/extras/fcf626ec0f16c76be79657ca90613a8d.poster.avif?t=1769382556\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3652690/extras/fcf626ec0f16c76be79657ca90613a8d.webm?t=1769382556\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3652690/extras/fcf626ec0f16c76be79657ca90613a8d.mp4?t=1769382556\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd26 <strong>Light, Sound, and Instinct</strong><br>Use your flashlight to navigate and listen closely for danger in the dark.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfda\ufe0f <strong>Environmental Storytelling</strong><br>Find notes, candles, and ritual items that reveal the tragedy behind the curse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you escape the field\u2026 or will you become part of it?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3652690/extras/edc14d7c3fff28b0ecdb4bc0ee6676e9.avif?t=1769382556\" width=600 height=331 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3652690?t=1769382556","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3652690/ff6e03a4cbe70a265bde3caa0498b3da373e1569/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1769382556","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3652690/fa634fe8e537a683ea6f3dee6dc231ef9528ac0b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769382556","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3652690/fa634fe8e537a683ea6f3dee6dc231ef9528ac0b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769382556","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This game contains mature themes, including references to death, grief, and occult rituals. Players may encounter unsettling imagery, ghostly apparitions, and scenes of implied violence. There is no graphic gore or sexual content, but the atmosphere and story elements are intended for mature audiences."},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":4104110,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3652690/extras/045245fceb0ad048f361d90f5118c539.poster.avif?t=1769382556\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3652690/extras/045245fceb0ad048f361d90f5118c539.webm?t=1769382556\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3652690/extras/045245fceb0ad048f361d90f5118c539.mp4?t=1769382556\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No One Leaves the Field</strong> is a first-person folk horror game set in a cursed wheat field that changes every time you enter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After swerving to a